{
  "name": "ListRdsDatabases",
  "summary": "查询RDS数据库列表",
  "tags": "审计数据库",
  "productshort": "DBSS",
  "region_id": "af-north-1",
  "paths": {
    "/v2/{project_id}/audit/databases/rds": {
      "get": {
        "x-apigateway-request-type": "public",
        "x-apigateway-ratelimit": "YunTanRateLimitDefault",
        "x-request-examples-url-1": "/v2/{project_id}/audit/databases/rds?db_type=MYSQL&offset=0&limit=10",
        "tags": [
          "审计数据库"
        ],
        "summary": "查询RDS数据库列表",
        "description": "查询RDS数据库列表",
        "operationId": "ListRdsDatabases",
        "x-is-registered": "Y",
        "x-api-type": "open-api",
        "x-support-sdk": "Y",
        "produces": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "default": "xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx",
            "description": "**参数解释**:\n用户Token。通过调用IAM服务查询用户Token接口获取(响应消息头中X-Subject-Token的值)。\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及\n**取值范围**:\nIAM服务查询用户Token接口为准\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及",
            "in": "header",
            "name": "X-Auth-Token",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 32,
            "maxLength": 2097152,
            "x-example": "MIIDkgYJKoZIhvcNAQcCoIIDgzCCXXXXX..."
          },
          {
            "name": "project_id",
            "minLength": 32,
            "maxLength": 64,
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "description": "**参数解释**:\n项目ID。可通过IAM服务[查询指定IAM用户的项目列表]接口获取。\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及\n**取值范围**:\n以IAM服务接口返回值为准,字符长度32-64。\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及"
          },
          {
            "name": "db_type",
            "in": "query",
            "required": true,
            "description": "**参数解释**:\n数据库类型\n**约束限制**:\n区分大小写,只能传递取值范围内的值\n**取值范围**:\n  - MYSQL: Mysql\n  - ORACLE: Oracle\n  - POSTGRESQL: PostgreSQL\n  - SQLSERVER: SQL Server\n  - DAMENG: DAMENG\n  - TAURUS: TaurusDB\n  - DWS: GaussDB DWS\n  - KINGBASE: KINGBASE\n  - MARIADB: MariaDB\n  - GAUSSDBOPENGAUSS: GaussDB/openGauss\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及",
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "MYSQL",
              "ORACLE",
              "POSTGRESQL",
              "SQLSERVER",
              "DAMENG",
              "TAURUS",
              "DWS",
              "KINGBASE",
              "MARIADB",
              "GAUSSDBOPENGAUSS"
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "offset",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "**参数解释**:\n分页偏移量,从第一条数据偏移offset条数据后开始查询\n**约束限制**:\n仅支持大于等于0的整数\n**取值范围**:\n大于等于0\n**默认取值**:\n默认值为0",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "limit",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "**参数解释**:\n每页查询记录数。\n**约束限制**:\n仅支持大于0的整数\n**取值范围**:\n大于0小于等于100\n**默认取值**:\n默认值为100",
            "type": "string"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "成功",
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/RdsDbListResponse"
            },
            "examples": {
              "application/json": {
                "databases": [
                  {
                    "id": "5a5c4ca8b10f4b00bc88e03866fe3fd4in01",
                    "db_name": "rds-cwx1216198",
                    "status": "ACTIVE",
                    "port": "3306",
                    "ip": "192.168.0.159",
                    "instance_name": "rds-cwx1216198",
                    "type": "MySQL",
                    "version": "5.7",
                    "is_supported": null,
                    "enterprise_id": "0"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "3f1cfaac552e42f1bb9855993586076cin01",
                    "db_name": "rds-5c25",
                    "status": "FROZEN",
                    "port": "3306",
                    "ip": "192.168.0.14",
                    "instance_name": "rds-5c25",
                    "type": "MySQL",
                    "version": "5.7",
                    "is_supported": null,
                    "enterprise_id": "0"
                  }
                ],
                "total_count": 2
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "请求参数错误",
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/DbssError"
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "认证失败",
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/DbssError"
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "服务器内部错误",
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/DbssError"
            }
          }
        },
        "x-hc": "Y",
        "x-hcso": "Y",
        "x-hk": "Y",
        "x-sbc": "Y",
        "x-open-region-cloud": "hc,hk,hcso,sbc",
        "x-order": 1
      }
    }
  },
  "definitions": {
    "DbssError": {
      "description": "异常消息体",
      "properties": {
        "details": {
          "description": "PDP5鉴权异常信息",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/DbssErrorDetail"
          },
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 0,
          "maxItems": 100
        },
        "encoded_authorization_message": {
          "description": "PDP5鉴权异常信息",
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 0,
          "maxLength": 2097152,
          "example": "DBSS.00112233"
        },
        "error_code": {
          "description": "错误码",
          "type": "string",
          "example": "DBSS.10020100",
          "minLength": 0,
          "maxLength": 2097152
        },
        "error_msg": {
          "description": "错误信息",
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 0,
          "maxLength": 2097152,
          "example": "DBSS.00112233"
        }
      },
      "type": "object"
    },
    "DbssErrorDetail": {
      "properties": {
        "error_code": {
          "description": "错误码",
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 0,
          "maxLength": 32,
          "example": "DBSS.00112233"
        },
        "error_msg": {
          "description": "PDP5错误信息",
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 0,
          "maxLength": 2097152,
          "example": "DBSS.00112233"
        }
      },
      "type": "object"
    },
    "RdsDbListResponse": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "databases",
        "total_count"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "databases": {
          "items": {
            "required": [
              "id",
              "db_name",
              "status",
              "port",
              "ip",
              "type",
              "version",
              "is_supported"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "id": {
                "type": "string",
                "example": "5a5c4ca8b10f4b00bc88e03866fe3fd4in01",
                "description": "ID"
              },
              "db_name": {
                "type": "string",
                "example": "rds-cwx1216198",
                "description": "数据库名称"
              },
              "status": {
                "type": "string",
                "example": "ACTIVE",
                "description": "实例状态。\n- BUILD:表示实例正在创建。\n- ACTIVE:表示实例正常。\n- FAILED:表示实例异常。\n- FROZEN:表示实例冻结。\n- MODIFYING:表示实例正在扩容。\n- REBOOTING:表示实例正在重启。\n- RESTORING:表示实例正在恢复。\n- MODIFYING INSTANCE TYPE:表示实例正在转主备。\n- SWITCHOVER:表示实例正在主备切换。\n- MIGRATING:表示实例正在迁移。\n- BACKING UP:表示实例正在进行备份。\n- MODIFYING DATABASE PORT:表示实例正在修改数据库端口。\n- STORAGE FULL:表示实例磁盘空间满。"
              },
              "port": {
                "type": "string",
                "example": 3306,
                "description": "数据库端口"
              },
              "ip": {
                "type": "string",
                "example": "192.168.0.159",
                "description": "数据库IP"
              },
              "instance_name": {
                "type": "string",
                "example": "rds-cwx1216198",
                "description": "rds实例名称"
              },
              "type": {
                "type": "string",
                "example": "MySQL",
                "description": "数据库类型\n- MYSQL:MySql\n- ORACLE:Oracle\n- POSTGRESQL:PostgreSQL\n- SQLSERVER:SQL Server\n- DAMENG:DAMENG\n- TAURUS:TaurusDB\n- DWS:GaussDB DWS\n- KINGBASE:KINGBASE\n- MARIADB:MariaDB\n- GAUSSDBOPENGAUSS:GaussDB/openGauss"
              },
              "version": {
                "type": "string",
                "example": 5.7,
                "description": "版本"
              },
              "is_supported": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "example": null,
                "description": "是否支持免agent审计"
              },
              "enterprise_id": {
                "type": "string",
                "example": 0,
                "description": "企业项目ID"
              }
            }
          },
          "description": "rds数据库列表",
          "type": "array"
        },
        "total_count": {
          "type": "integer",
          "format": "int32",
          "example": 7,
          "description": "总数"
        }
      }
    }
  },
